## 💻 Usage

### Training with RQE

```python
# Example training script
python train.py \
    --dataset BdSLW401 \
    --encoding RQE \
    --model SLRT \
    --epochs 100 \
    --batch_size 32
```

### Inference

```python
# Example inference
python inference.py \
    --model_path checkpoints/rqe_model.pth \
    --video_path sample_video.mp4 \
    --encoding RQE
```

### Evaluation

```python
# Evaluate on benchmark datasets
python evaluate.py \
    --dataset WLASL100 \
    --model_path checkpoints/rqe_model.pth \
    --encoding RQE
```

